## Objective (designed by the tester)

Prove that the AT-x960-56YSQ acts as a **RADIUS client (NAS)**: that `radius-server host` with
a shared key plus `aaa authentication login default group radius local` makes a real login on
the DUT produce an Access-Request to the configured server and act on its answer; that
`aaa accounting login default start-stop group radius` produces matching Accounting Start and
Stop records; that the method list behaves correctly for an Accept, a Reject, a mismatched
shared key and an unreachable server; and that the whole configuration is removable.

Baseline-OFF first, controls on every leg, then removal.

