  * **Authentication over SSH/HTTP/telnet**, and `aaa authentication enable default group
    radius`. Only console login was exercised. The DUT's `NAS-Identifier='console'` shows the
    attribute that would distinguish them.
  * **`deadtime`**, multiple servers and server ordering. One server was configured.
  * **`radius-server source-interface`** -- left "not configured"; the DUT sourced from
